# D3.js v6 Tooltips and Legends

## Tooltips

### Creating a Tooltip Div
```javascript
const tooltip = d3.select("body")
  .append("div")
  .attr("class", "tooltip")
  .style("position", "absolute")
  .style("opacity", 0)
  .style("pointer-events", "none");
```

### CSS Styling
```css
